{"id":"625484","name":"槐花锅盔","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/625484/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"槐花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"发酵粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"花椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花生油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉适量。","img":"images/625484/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"发酵粉温水化开。","img":"images/625484/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"酵母水倒面粉中，搅成大絮。","img":"images/625484/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"揉成较软的面团，自然饧发。","img":"images/625484/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"发好的面团。","img":"images/625484/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"洗净控好水的槐花。","img":"images/625484/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"槐花放面团上。","img":"images/625484/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"撒上适量盐，自己卤的花椒粉，少许食用油。","img":"images/625484/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"揉均匀。","img":"images/625484/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取一半槐花面团。","img":"images/625484/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"稍揉两下。","img":"images/625484/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"擀成稍约1厘米厚的圆，饧10分钟。","img":"images/625484/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"电饼铛刷油，槐花锅盔放入，上面也倒适量油。","img":"images/625484/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"刷均匀。上下盖加热，烙大约5分钟。","img":"images/625484/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"翻面，用牙签均匀扎些小孔。","img":"images/625484/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"再翻面，也用牙签均匀扎小孔。","img":"images/625484/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"锅盔上再刷薄薄一层油，盖上盖再烙5分钟。","img":"images/625484/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"勤翻面，烙至两面金黄即可。","img":"images/625484/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"切小块。","img":"images/625484/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"配上炒好的海天豆瓣酱，味道不错哦。","img":"images/625484/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/625484/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/625484/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}